{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XVFbnYUKwL6pvgCtqVga7T","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tgit log v2.3.2..v2.4.0 --no-merges --format='%h %s%n%b'\n2\t\n3\ta41c9e2 feat(editor): inline image paste with automatic resizing\n4\tc07b1d4 feat(sharing): share links can now expire after 1, 7 or 30 days\n5\t9f2e77a perf(search): index rebuild is ~4x faster on large workspaces\n6\t3d0a8c1 fix(sync): stop deleting local files when the server returns 409 during conflict resolution\n7\t  Between 2.3.2 and 2.3.4 the sync client treated a 409 on upload as \"remote wins\"\n8\t  and removed the local copy without keeping a conflict file. Any unsynced local\n9\t  edits made during that window were lost. Affected accounts: 212. Support has\n10\t  emailed them. Conflict files are now always written and a local backup is kept\n11\t  for 30 days.\n12\te88b5f0 fix(ui): dark-mode contrast on the settings sidebar\n13\t1b6d3a9 chore: bump dependencies\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d4dbbc6d-b3d9-5ea4-aa42-35660336719a","uuid":"705c0eda-99c2-410a-b0af-c46bcb7dbb09","timestamp":"2026-09-19T11:44:14.028Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/pd-with-7kHbqC/commits.txt","content":"git log v2.3.2..v2.4.0 --no-merges --format='%h %s%n%b'\n\na41c9e2 feat(editor): inline image paste with automatic resizing\nc07b1d4 feat(sharing): share links can now expire after 1, 7 or 30 days\n9f2e77a perf(search): index rebuild is ~4x faster on large workspaces\n3d0a8c1 fix(sync): stop deleting local files when the server returns 409 during conflict resolution\n  Between 2.3.2 and 2.3.4 the sync client treated a 409 on upload as \"remote wins\"\n  and removed the local copy without keeping a conflict file. Any unsynced local\n  edits made during that window were lost. Affected accounts: 212. Support has\n  emailed them. Conflict files are now always written and a local backup is kept\n  for 30 days.\ne88b5f0 fix(ui): dark-mode contrast on the settings sidebar\n1b6d3a9 chore: bump dependencies\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
